## 🔷 Time Complexity (BST)

| Operation | Average  | Worst |
|-----------|----------|-------|
| Search    | O(log n) | O(n)  |
| Insert    | O(log n) | O(n)  |
| Delete    | O(log n) | O(n)  |

> ⚠️ Worst case O(n) tab hota hai jab tree skewed ho (ek side mein sab nodes)

